---
---
<div class="view" data-view="galeri">
  <section class="bg-bark pt-32 pb-16 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
      <p class="eyebrow text-white/70 mb-4">
        <span class="w-6 h-px bg-white/40"></span> Galeri
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-bold text-white text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-tight">
        Momen di Nimo Group
      </h1>
      <p class="text-white/65 text-sm sm:text-base mt-5 max-w-xl">
        Klik salah satu foto untuk membukanya dalam tampilan penuh. Gunakan tombol panah di layar,
        atau tombol <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-white/25 text-[11px]">&larr;</kbd>
        dan <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-white/25 text-[11px]">&rarr;</kbd>
        pada keyboard, untuk berpindah.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-surface py-14 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
      <div id="galleryGrid" class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
